RequiredDemandAtPriceTest
├── when remainingMps is 0
│   └── it reverts
├── when price is 0
│   └── it returns 0
├── when supply is 0
│   └── it returns 0
├── when supply GT 0 and price GT 0
│   ├── when remainingMps is MPS
│   │   └── it returns remainingSupplyQ96X7 * priceQ96 divUp Q96 * MPS
│   └── when remainingMps LT MPS
│       └── it returns remainingSupplyQ96X7 * priceQ96 divUp Q96 * remainingMps
└── rollover
    ├── when remaining supply equals expected schedule
    │   └── it returns totalSupply * priceQ96
    └── when remaining supply is greater than expected schedule
        └── it returns demand greater than totalSupply * priceQ96
